      "source": "Should <i>not</i> return the same instance of the <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/ClassLoader.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>ClassLoader</code></a>\nreturned from an invocation of <a href=\"../LoadTimeWeaver.html#getInstrumentableClassLoader()\"><code>LoadTimeWeaver.getInstrumentableClassLoader()</code></a>.",
