      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "May be the current <code>ClassLoader</code>, or a <code>ClassLoader</code>\ncreated by this <a href=\"../LoadTimeWeaver.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.instrument.classloading\"><code>LoadTimeWeaver</code></a> instance.",
