    {
      "source": "<code><a href=\"../LoadTimeWeaver.html#getThrowawayClassLoader()\">getThrowawayClassLoader</a></code> in interface <code><a href=\"../LoadTimeWeaver.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.instrument.classloading\">LoadTimeWeaver</a></code>",
      "translation": "`<a href=\"../LoadTimeWeaver.html#getThrowawayClassLoader()\">getThrowawayClassLoader</a>` 接口 `<a href=\"../LoadTimeWeaver.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.instrument.classloading\">LoadTimeWeaver</a>` 中的方法。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "<code>classLoader</code> - the <code>ClassLoader</code> to delegate to for weaving",
      "translation": "<code>classLoader</code> - 用于织入操作的委托 <code>ClassLoader</code>",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Return a <code>ClassLoader</code> that supports instrumentation\nthrough AspectJ-style load-time weaving based on user-defined\n<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.instrument/java/lang/instrument/ClassFileTransformer.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang.instrument\"><code>ClassFileTransformers</code></a>.",
      "translation": "返回一个支持基于用户定义的<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.instrument/java/lang/instrument/ClassFileTransformer.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang.instrument\"><code>ClassFileTransformers</code></a>进行 AspectJ 风格加载时织入的<code>ClassLoader</code>。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Return a throwaway <code>ClassLoader</code>, enabling classes to be\nloaded and inspected without affecting the parent <code>ClassLoader</code>.",
      "translation": "返回一个临时的 <code>ClassLoader</code>，使类能够在不影响父级 <code>ClassLoader</code> 的情况下被加载和检查。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<code>transformer</code> - the <code>ClassFileTransformer</code> to add",
      "translation": "<code>transformer</code> - 要添加的 <code>ClassFileTransformer</code>",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "the <code>ClassLoader</code> which will expose\ninstrumented classes according to the registered transformers",
      "translation": "将按注册的转换器暴露已增强类的<code>ClassLoader</code>",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "a temporary throwaway <code>ClassLoader</code>; should return\na new instance for each call, with no existing state",
      "translation": "一个临时的、一次性使用的 <code>ClassLoader</code>；每次调用都应返回一个新实例，且不带有任何现有状态。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
